menu "H6.1 Tool Registry"

config LUA_HW_BINDINGS
    bool "Expose hw.* bindings in the Lua sandbox"
    default y
    help
        H6.1 M3 device API for tool packs: hw.millis, hw.gpio_write,
        hw.gpio_read, hw.adc_read (ADC1), hw.kv_set / hw.kv_get (a
        device-owned key-value store under /littlefs/kv — the
        "configure" deploy-mode seam). Pins are whitelisted (USB,
        flash and PSRAM pins are excluded). Disable for a locked-down
        build; tool packs that wrap hw.* then degrade to clean error
        strings.

endmenu
